      "postDate": "2026-09-11T14:25:20.340Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Laws vary by country but typically you have the right to access your healthcare data. In my country (Germany) patients still frequently get CDs from the radiologist xD\n\nBut even if the data is transferred digitally from radiology to orthopedics or wherever you can ask and they have no reason to not give you your own data (or are even bound by law to give you the data) \n",
